{"id": "long_01", "output": "Okay, so this is just a quick update on the migration project.\n\nSo where we are right now is that the database schema is done and the backfill script is running on staging. It should finish by tonight, I think.\n\nThe main risk is still the reporting service, because it reads from the old tables directly and nobody has touched that code in like two years. So we're gonna need someone to go through it carefully.\n\nI was going to ask Ravi to do it, but actually no, Ravi is out next week. So let's ask Mei instead.\n\nOther than that, we're on track for the cutover on the fourteenth. Wait, no, the fourteenth because the twelfth is a Saturday and we don't want to do it on a weekend. So yeah, the fourteenth.\n\nLet me know if you have any concerns or if I missed anything. Thanks.", "timings": {"cache_n": 472, "prompt_n": 192, "prompt_ms": 40.588, "prompt_per_token_ms": 0.21139583333333334, "prompt_per_second": 4730.462205578004, "predicted_n": 188, "predicted_ms": 843.249, "predicted_per_token_ms": 4.509352941176471, "predicted_per_second": 221.76130656543913, "wall_ms": 887.2447359999569, "finish": "stop"}}
